# Synapes Studio Cline Engineering Guidelines
1. Always uphold zero fake-activity behavior: fail loudly on missing keys, blank inputs, and external API errors instead of fabricating fallback media or mock status updates.
2. Never start local Docker daemons or PyTorch inference models on the host Windows 8GB RAM laptop; route heavy GPU work to Railway (`swarm-orchestrator`) and Kaggle Dual-T4 (`scripts/kaggle_comfyui_worker.py`).
3. Keep `scripts/verify-integrity.cjs` (Groups 1-12), `vitest` tests, and `tsc -b && vite build` green after every code change.
